      en: ["Lantoto National Park covers an area of 760 square kilometers.", "The forest is located in Central Equatoria State near the border town of Yei.", "It is one of the few confirmed habitats for chimpanzees in South Sudan.", "The park forms a transboundary corridor with Garamba National Park in DRC.", "The vegetation is a mix of open woodland and dense gallery forest.", "Government protection for the forest was officially enacted in 1986."],
      es: ["Superficie: aprox. 200 km²", "Precipitación anual: >1.500 mm", "Altura del árbol: hasta 40 m", "Especies de mamíferos: más de 50", "Especies de aves: más de 200", "Especies en peligro: chimpancé, elefante de bosque"],
      pt: ["Área: aprox. 200 km²", "Precipitação anual: >1.500 mm", "Altura das árvores: até 40 m", "Espécies de mamíferos: mais de 50", "Espécies de aves: mais de 200", "Espécies ameaçadas: chimpanzé, elefante-da-floresta"],
      fr: ["Surface : env. 200 km²", "Précipitations annuelles : >1 500 mm", "Hauteur des arbres : jusqu'à 40 m", "Espèces de mammifères : plus de 50", "Espèces d'oiseaux : plus de 200", "Espèces menacées : chimpanzé, éléphant de forêt"],
